    <briefdescription>
<para>Head pose paired with a rendered texture, used for asynchronous reprojection. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Carries both the pose at which a frame was rendered and the rendered image so that downstream stages can re-project the image to a more current pose. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
